  "description": {
    "en": "The Yonex OSAKA EZONE 98 Gold/Purple Limited Edition was created in collaboration with Naomi Osaka and Mari Osaka as a special cosmetic version of the 7th-generation EZONE 98. Its design features dragons and spider lilies, symbolizing strength, beauty, power and fighting spirit. Performance remains based on the power-and-comfort focused EZONE 98 platform.",

    "zh": "Yonex OSAKA EZONE 98 Gold/Purple Limited Edition 是 Naomi Osaka 与其姐姐 Mari Osaka 联合 Yonex 研发团队共同设计的限定版本，以第7代 EZONE 98 为性能基础。球拍采用金色与紫色配色，并融入龙与彼岸花元素，象征力量、好运、坚韧、美丽与战斗精神。其性能定位仍延续 EZONE 98 的力量与舒适特性，主要区别在于限定联名外观及收藏属性。"
